{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此序既載於續藏經第五套合論卷首，故今省之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如漸教十地、圓教十地等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十方世界法門皆是四諦法門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "《大方廣佛華嚴經合論纂要》（日本京都大學藏經書院文庫藏寫本第7圖第9行）"}
